{"audio":{"src":"https://pub-13abeb101e2945d2a7f60234f6faf52e.r2.dev/materials/2026-07-24-hobbies-a2/audio/main-47c61d68a8f7.mp3","durationSec":188.4,"cues":[{"start":0,"end":1.92,"text":"People choose hobbies for many reasons."},{"start":3.18,"end":6.34,"text":"Some want to relax after a busy day at work or school."},{"start":7.12,"end":8.52,"text":"Others want to feel creative."},{"start":9.52,"end":13.88,"text":"For example, Mia started painting because her job was very stressful."},{"start":14.68,"end":16.5,"text":"She says painting helps her feel calm."},{"start":17.66,"end":20.46,"text":"Some people choose hobbies because they want to learn something new."},{"start":21.06,"end":25.48,"text":"For example, Carlos started learning to cook when he moved to a new city."},{"start":26.14,"end":28.16,"text":"He wanted to make the food he missed from home."},{"start":28.9,"end":33.34,"text":"A hobby gives you time to do something you enjoy, just for yourself."},{"start":34.7,"end":37.32,"text":"Some hobbies are solo — you do them alone."},{"start":37.32,"end":42.06,"text":"Reading, journaling, and gardening are common solo hobbies."},{"start":42.84,"end":44.3,"text":"They are quiet and personal."},{"start":45.2,"end":48.04,"text":"Other hobbies are social — you do them with other people."},{"start":48.86,"end":52.96,"text":"Team sports, board game clubs, and choir groups are social hobbies."},{"start":53.78,"end":56.5,"text":"For example, Priya joined a local running club."},{"start":56.5,"end":61.58,"text":"She says she enjoys the exercise, but she also likes talking to people after the run."},{"start":62.58,"end":63.96,"text":"Both types have value."},{"start":63.96,"end":66.68,"text":"Solo hobbies give you quiet time to think."},{"start":67.58,"end":70.56,"text":"Social hobbies help you connect with others and feel less alone."},{"start":71.34,"end":73.86,"text":"Many hobbies help you build real skills over time."},{"start":74.7,"end":77.92,"text":"When you practice, you get better — and that feels good."},{"start":78.66,"end":82.9,"text":"For example, Tom started playing the guitar as a hobby three years ago."},{"start":83.38,"end":86.38,"text":"At first, his fingers hurt and the sounds were not nice."},{"start":87.18,"end":89.2,"text":"Now he plays songs for his family."},{"start":90.16,"end":92.62,"text":"He did not plan to become a professional musician."},{"start":93.32,"end":95.84,"text":"He just kept practising because he enjoyed it."},{"start":96.68,"end":99.5,"text":"Some hobby skills are also useful in other parts of life."},{"start":100.02,"end":105,"text":"For example, someone who blogs as a hobby often becomes a better writer at work too."},{"start":106.06,"end":108.8,"text":"Two common problems with hobbies are time and money."},{"start":109.6,"end":112.3,"text":"Many people say they want a hobby but feel too busy."},{"start":112.3,"end":114.74,"text":"A useful idea is to start small."},{"start":115.44,"end":118.86,"text":"Even fifteen or twenty minutes a few times a week is enough to begin."},{"start":119.68,"end":124.52,"text":"For example, Yuki wanted to learn watercolour painting but only had short breaks in her day."},{"start":125.32,"end":128.66,"text":"She started with ten-minute sketches and slowly built up."},{"start":129.52,"end":133.58,"text":"Some hobbies also cost money — equipment, lessons, or materials."},{"start":134.44,"end":136.12,"text":"But not all hobbies are expensive."},{"start":136.98,"end":141.54,"text":"Walking, writing, and learning a language with free apps cost very little."},{"start":142.6,"end":147.02,"text":"The key is to match the hobby to your real life, not an imaginary perfect schedule."},{"start":148.52,"end":150.1,"text":"Starting a new hobby can feel difficult."},{"start":150.86,"end":153.5,"text":"You might worry about being bad at it or looking silly."},{"start":154.04,"end":155.68,"text":"But everyone starts as a beginner."},{"start":157.14,"end":164.62,"text":"A good way to begin is to try one small step — watch a short video, borrow a book, or go to one introductory class."},{"start":165.26,"end":167.68,"text":"For example, Leo had never cooked before."},{"start":167.68,"end":173.38,"text":"He watched one online cooking video each weekend and tried the recipe the same day."},{"start":173.94,"end":177.5,"text":"After two months, he felt confident enough to cook for a friend."},{"start":181.42,"end":183.68,"text":"You do not need to be perfect to enjoy a hobby."},{"start":184.42,"end":187.96,"text":"The most important thing is that you find it interesting and keep going."}],"words":[{"text":"People","start":0,"end":0.24},{"text":"choose","start":0.24,"end":0.62},{"text":"hobbies","start":0.62,"end":0.96},{"text":"for","start":0.96,"end":1.24},{"text":"many","start":1.24,"end":1.42},{"text":"reasons","start":1.42,"end":1.92},{"text":"Some","start":3.18,"end":3.26},{"text":"want","start":3.26,"end":3.5},{"text":"to","start":3.5,"end":3.68},{"text":"relax","start":3.68,"end":4.12},{"text":"after","start":4.12,"end":4.56},{"text":"a","start":4.56,"end":4.74},{"text":"busy","start":4.74,"end":4.94},{"text":"day","start":4.94,"end":5.2},{"text":"at","start":5.2,"end":5.36},{"text":"work","start":5.36,"end":5.66},{"text":"or","start":5.66,"end":5.92},{"text":"school","start":5.92,"end":6.34},{"text":"Others","start":7.12,"end":7.34},{"text":"want","start":7.34,"end":7.66},{"text":"to","start":7.66,"end":7.84},{"text":"feel","start":7.84,"end":8.02},{"text":"creative","start":8.02,"end":8.52},{"text":"For","start":9.52,"end":9.62},{"text":"example","start":9.62,"end":10.04},{"text":"Mia","start":10.92,"end":10.96},{"text":"started","start":10.96,"end":11.36},{"text":"painting","start":11.36,"end":11.84},{"text":"because","start":11.84,"end":12.42},{"text":"her","start":12.42,"end":12.62},{"text":"job","start":12.62,"end":12.94},{"text":"was","start":12.94,"end":13.14},{"text":"very","start":13.14,"end":13.42},{"text":"stressful","start":13.